# Voice STT

- Parse both orders: `1 kilo chini` and `chini 1 kilo`; support `adha`/`आधा`.
- Commit cart on stable complete phrase (~700ms); do not wait for cancel.
- Clear transcript UI after successful cart add.
- iOS: never restart SFSpeechRecognizer synchronously in the recognition callback (error 216). Defer restart.
- Android: emit `Started` once per mic session; soft-retry busy/network; commit last partial on NO_MATCH.
- Do not surface raw platform STT errors in order UI while listening.
- Match products via `ProductFuzzyMatcher` on `name` / `nameHi` / `voiceAlias`.
- Out of stock / unknown → `{name} stock me nahi hai`.

Before deep edits, read skill `pansari-voice-stt` if present.
